 Am I as good as a big hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene III.
Lady Macbeth:
 Am I as good as the sum of a big hero and a hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene IV.
Lady Macbeth:
 Am I as good as a big big hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene V.
Lady Macbeth:
